hadiths[40]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Khabar dekhne ki tarah nahi hota."
"2","[AI-translation] Jung fareb hai."
"3","[AI-translation] Musalman musalman ka aina hai."
"4","[AI-translation] Jis se mashwara kiya jaye woh amaanatdaar hai."
"5","[AI-translation] Neki ki taraf rasta dikhane wala, nek amal karne wale ke jaisa hai."
"6","[AI-translation] Apni hawaish ke liye raazdari se madad lo."
"7","[AI-translation] Aag se bacho, agarche aadhi khajoor se hi."
"8","[AI-translation] Duniya momin ka qaid khana aur kafir ki jannat hai."
"9","[AI-translation] Haya sarasar khair hai."
"10","[AI-translation] Momin ka wada haath pakadne ki tarah hota hai."
"11","[AI-translation] Kisi momin ke liye jayez nahi ke woh apne bhai se teen din se zyada hijrat kare."
"12","[AI-translation] Hum mein se nahi hai woh jo hum mein dhoka kare."
"13","[AI-translation] Jo kam ho aur kaafi ho woh behtar hai us se jo zyada ho aur ghaafil kare."
"14","[AI-translation] Jo apni tohfa wapas le woh apni qay wapas khaane wale ki tarah hai."
"15","[AI-translation] Balaa qaul ka muwakkil hai."
"16","[AI-translation] Log kangi ke danton ki tarah hain."
"17","[AI-translation] Ghina nafs ka ghina hai."
"18","[AI-translation] Saeed woh hai jo doosron ke zariye naseehat pa le."
"19","[AI-translation] Aur yaqeenan kuch shair mein hikmat hoti hai aur yaqeenan kuch bayaan mein seher hota hai."
"20","[AI-translation] Badshahon ka maaf karna mulk ko baaqi rakhne wala hai."
"21","[AI-translation] Aadmi apne mehbub ke saath hai."
"22","[AI-translation] Apni qadar ko jaanne wala aadmi tabah nahi hota."
"23","[AI-translation] Bachcha farash ka hai aur zina karne wale ke liye pathar hai."
"24","[AI-translation] Upar wala haath neeche wale haath se behtar hai."
"25","[AI-translation] Allah us ka shukar nahi karta jo logon ka shukar nahi karta."
"26","[AI-translation] Kisi cheez se mohabbat andhi aur behri kar deti hai."
"27","[AI-translation] Dilon par fitrat ki gayi hai apne ehsaan karne wale se mohabbat aur bure sulook karne wale se nafrat ki."
"28","[AI-translation] Gunah se tauba karne wala us jaisa hai jis par koi gunah nahi."
"29","[AI-translation] Haazir woh dekhta hai jo gaayab nahi dekhta."
"30","[AI-translation] Jab kisi qaum ka kareem shakhs tumhare paas aaye toh uski ikraam karo."
"31","[AI-translation] Jhooti qasam gharon ko veeran kar deti hai."
"32","[AI-translation] Jo apne maal ki hifazat karte hue qatl ho gaya woh shaheed hai."
"33","[AI-translation] Aamaal ka daromadar niyat par hai."
"34","[AI-translation] Qaum ka sardar unka khadim hota hai."
"35","[AI-translation] Umoor mein behtareen darmiyan wala hai."
"36","[AI-translation] Aey Allah! Meri ummat mein khamis ke din savere barkat farma."
"37","[AI-translation] Faqr kufr ke qareeb tha."
"38","[AI-translation] Safar azaab ka ek tukra hai."
"39","[AI-translation] Behtareen zakhira taqwa hai."
"40","[AI-translation] Majalis amanat hain."
